@TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5076

POST {{TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "username": "admin", 
  "password": "Admin123"
}

### Тест 2: Неверный логин или пароль
POST {{TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admi",
  "password": "Admin123"
}

### Тест 3: Обновление токена
POST {{TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/refresh
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "aMdRAh68vBJbB3KQODggcWR9ooaDN3+hY1sT8zVK2I8="
}